# Images of the security tools of the pipeline (.github/workflows/security.yml, scripts/scan-images.sh,
# scripts/test-dast.sh). Each one is pinned to a version and its digest: a tag that is moved or replaced on the
# registry cannot change what runs. Renovate raises them (renovate.json, "security tools").
